{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415659","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415659","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041565901:1":{"text":"奈萨雷斯的残暴统治结束了，接下来的管理应当更温和一些。","source_cn":"奈萨雷斯的残暴统治结束了，接下来的管理应当更温和一些。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F106590F758ACFA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041565902:1":{"text":"为了避免昔日的惨剧重演……","source_cn":"为了避免昔日的惨剧重演……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF000344261624A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041565903:1":{"text":"朋友，我想你走上了歧途。","source_cn":"朋友，我想你走上了歧途。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2FC67C48ACDB78FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041565904:1":{"text":"你认为，用什么才能覆盖惩戒的痛楚呢？","source_cn":"你认为，用什么才能覆盖惩戒的痛楚呢？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DEBD0677D72EA24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041565905:1":{"text":"……安慰？照料？体贴？","source_cn":"……安慰？照料？体贴？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x52E96F042CE1C66F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041565906:1":{"text":"不，亲爱的朋友，恰好相反。","source_cn":"不，亲爱的朋友，恰好相反。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x951CF29B62D29474","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041565907:1":{"text":"想要覆盖痛楚，唯有给予更强的痛楚。","source_cn":"想要覆盖痛楚，唯有给予更强的痛楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC7F7237874A2A873","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041565908:1":{"text":"倘若如你所说，此前的惨剧已经走上歧途，那么正道就必须更加残忍才能纠正。","source_cn":"倘若如你所说，此前的惨剧已经走上歧途，那么正道就必须更...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x518D3A6206E62830","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041565909:1":{"text":"哈！什么逻辑！","source_cn":"哈！什么逻辑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4216AA327223B11","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041565910:1":{"text":"惩罚、戒律，这一切原本就是反直觉——或者说是平民的直觉的，我经验不足的朋友。","source_cn":"惩罚、戒律，这一切原本就是反直觉——或者说是平民的直觉...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B5608624B5F1A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041565911:1":{"text":"记住，你所给予的一切，都是“奖赏”，无论鞭子还是糖果。","source_cn":"记住，你所给予的一切，都是“奖赏”，无论鞭子还是糖果。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32432980C9E4B275","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041565912:1":{"text":"鞭子越严厉，糖果才会越甜美。","source_cn":"鞭子越严厉，糖果才会越甜美。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE74BA71BF3AC67B4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1041565913:1":{"text":"唯有如此，民众们才能在你的纪律下，服从如乖顺的羔羊。","source_cn":"唯有如此，民众们才能在你的纪律下，服从如乖顺的羔羊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDEC9B24F0A96A007","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1041565914:1":{"text":"若是尚有兴趣，还可以驯养些乖巧的猎犬。","source_cn":"若是尚有兴趣，还可以驯养些乖巧的猎犬。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6210FA8BE0E9CDF9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1041565915:1":{"text":"相信我，过程或许有些麻烦，但结果一定会令你满意。","source_cn":"相信我，过程或许有些麻烦，但结果一定会令你满意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD0A72FE46391E3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1041565916:1":{"text":"如果狗反咬一口，恐怕滋味不太美妙吧。","source_cn":"如果狗反咬一口，恐怕滋味不太美妙吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AACF8BB7571991F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1041565917:1":{"text":"……真遗憾。","source_cn":"……真遗憾。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x362D48F33ACCB801","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1041565918:1":{"text":"我原本以为我们的职责相同，会很有共同语言呢。","source_cn":"我原本以为我们的职责相同，会很有共同语言呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACB9445EB47E223C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1041565919:1":{"text":"我与我一些有着相同嗜好的高贵友人们不同，对出身并无特别的偏见。","source_cn":"我与我一些有着相同嗜好的高贵友人们不同，对出身并无特别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4C8E2C643659BBE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1041565920:1":{"text":"但，此时我也不得不承认。平民总归是有平民的软弱之处。","source_cn":"但，此时我也不得不承认。平民总归是有平民的软弱之处。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24528F22369ACF28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1041565921:1":{"text":"不巧，我也正是为了粉碎所谓“贵族的残酷”，才一路走到此处的。","source_cn":"不巧，我也正是为了粉碎所谓“贵族的残酷”，才一路走到此处的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6EBF3BCC4EF766A7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1041565922:1":{"text":"就算我曾经做过与你相似的恶行，但幸运或者不幸的是，我始终是你口中的“猎犬”。","source_